        "parms": "# counter — counting bangs\nEach bang adds the step to the count and sends the new count as an int. The first argument is the start value, 0 by default, and the second the step, 1 by default. The right inlet changes the step, a number on the left inlet sets the count and sends it, and reset goes back to the start value without sending.\nMax's counter also counts between a minimum and a maximum, up, down or back and forth, and has a carry outlet. Here counter has one outlet and counts on for ever: wrap it with %, fold it with pong, and catch the wrap with sel 0.",
